    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Tier 1 — Goetic Summoner</strong></p><p><strong>“First lesson: the circle protects you. Second lesson: only if it’s perfect.”</strong></p><p>You learn the etiquette of predators: names, constraints, and the price of eye contact. You are not yet strong enough to command, but you are strong enough to be heard.</p><p><strong>Tactical (Character Scale)</strong></p><ul><li>Gain a skill rank in <strong>Occult</strong> and <strong>Intimidation</strong></li><li>Learn <strong>Find Familiar</strong>, flavored as unsettling, watchful, or veil-adjacent</li></ul><p><strong>Strategic (Faction Scale)</strong></p><ul><li>When your faction attempts intimidation, coercion, or violent leverage, gain <strong>+1 to the relevant Violence OP roll</strong></li><li>When your faction runs reconnaissance, blackmail, or covert acquisition, gain <strong>+1 to the relevant Intrigue OP roll</strong></li><li>When your faction attempts goodwill, legitimacy, or mass Diplomacy, suffer <strong>–1 to the relevant Soft Power OP roll</strong></li></ul><p><strong>Cost:</strong> early Goetic work leaves an obvious scent. Expect attention from the wrong entities, fear from the right people, and a reputation that arrives before you do.</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
